\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O GOD of Love, To Thee We bow,
\par And pray for these before Thee now,
\par That, closely knit in holy vow,
\par They may in Thee be one.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. When days are filled with pure delight,
\par When paths are plain and skies are bright,
\par Walking by faith and not by sight,
\par May they in Thee be one.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. When stormy winds fulfil Thy will,
\par And all their good seems turned to ill,
\par Then trusting completely, still 
\par May they in Thee be one.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Whate'er in life shall be their share
\par Of quickening care or burdening care,
\par In power to do and grace to bear,
\par May they in Thee be one.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Eternal love, with them abide;
\par In Thee for ever may they hide,
\par For even death cannot divide
\par Those whom Thou makest one.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

